{{unknown|en|Origin unknown}};<ref name="OED">{{R:OED Online|pos=n.'' and ''adj|id=166152|date=March 2023}}</ref> possibly a variant of {{m|en|rickety|t=of an object: not strong or sturdy; of a person: feeble in the joints, tottering}}, {{glossary|reduplication|reduplicated}} with a change of the initial {{glossary|consonant}}.<ref>{{R:Dictionary.com|pos=adj.'' and ''n|source=Random House}}</ref> The {{glossary|noun}} is attested earlier than the {{glossary|adjective}}.<ref name="OED"/>

